<< /Alt (Valley View's tee time page in the narrow layout with the keyboard Tab order marked. Badges 1 through 9 sit on the menu button, the site title link, the course dropdown, the previous day button, the date dropdown, the next day button, the terms link, the View Booking Rules link, and the Change button. One box labeled Skipped by Tab covers the time of day, player, and holes filter buttons, and another box labeled Never reached by Tab covers the list of tee times.) /K 3 /P 142 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
